            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kode dengan mengatur <code>headers</code>, <code>params</code>, dan <code>data</code> dengan benar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"headers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;api-key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_SECRET_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"params = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;coding&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Learn Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests.put(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://mimo.org/api/update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", headers=headers, params=params, json=data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"173\" endIndex=\"180\" /><option startIndex=\"189\" endIndex=\"195\" /><option startIndex=\"202\" endIndex=\"206\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>headers</code>, diikuti oleh <code>params</code>, lalu <code>data</code>, <code>headers</code>, <code>params</code>, <code>data</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan <code>api-key</code> untuk key, <code>category</code> untuk <code>coding</code>, dan <code>title</code> untuk <code>Learn Python</code>.</p><p>Lampirkan headers dahulu, parameter query kedua, dan body JSON terakhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"auth\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;api-key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;MY_SECRET_KEY&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;coding&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"payload\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;title&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\":\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Learn Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"requests\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"put\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;http://mimo.org/api/update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"headers\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"auth\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"params\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"filters\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"json\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"payload\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"178\" /><option startIndex=\"180\" endIndex=\"194\" /><option startIndex=\"196\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json=auth\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"headers=filters\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params=payload\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"api-key\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"category\"</code>, <code>\"title\"</code>, <code>headers=auth</code>, <code>params=filters</code>, dan terakhir <code>json=payload</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131999,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi dictionary dengan mendefinisikan parameter query.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"params = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;popularity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;limit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/api/languages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", params=params)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(response.json())\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    &quot;languages&quot;: [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"        {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;interpreted&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;popularity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;creator&quot;: &quot;Guido van Rossum&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;first_appeared&quot;: 1991\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"        }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    &quot;total_results&quot;: 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"popularity\": \"high\",</code>, lalu <code>\"limit\": 1</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi dictionary dengan mendefinisikan parameter query.</p><p>Gunakan GET untuk meminta popularitas tinggi dengan batas angka <code>1</code>, lalu tampilkan JSON hasil.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"params = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;popularity&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&quot;limit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/api/languages&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", params=params)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(response.json())\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;popularity&quot;: &quot;low&quot;,\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;limit&quot;: &quot;1&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"requests.post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"headers=params\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    &quot;languages&quot;: [\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"        {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;interpreted&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;popularity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;creator&quot;: &quot;Guido van Rossum&quot;,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"            &quot;first_appeared&quot;: 1991\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"        }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    ],\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    &quot;total_results&quot;: 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"popularity\": \"high\",</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"limit\": 1</code>, <code>requests.get</code>, dan terakhir <code>params=params</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
